{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.poster.avif?t=1762007639\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.webm?t=1762007639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.mp4?t=1762007639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It changes completely how you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No longer are you glued to the ground. Now you can use your surrounding to reach places that were formerly impossible to reach.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arenas are made with parkour in mind, giving you space to use it in new and creative ways. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.poster.avif?t=1762007639\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.webm?t=1762007639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/7c919b501c1115f059d7735f1f37353f.mp4?t=1762007639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play as you want</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a huge arsenal of weapons with unique abilities and play styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your service are four weapons with many more added in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battleaxe \u2192 wrecking ball of the team with high aoe damage and high health </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dusack \u2192 super fast assassin with lots of burst damage and the ability to make an enemy player take 10% more damage from everyone </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boltthrower \u2192 marksman that gets huge damage the longer the match goes and has a devastating AOE ultimate ability </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragon Mirror \u2192 high single target healing with automatic self heal</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1656080?t=1762007639","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1656080?t=1762007639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/5a6a12783960766b49444a8ce1a4e98a931502a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762007639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/5a6a12783960766b49444a8ce1a4e98a931502a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762007639","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.poster.avif?t=1762007639\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.webm?t=1762007639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1656080/extras/da179ca294d8f502697ecabf90da4a51.mp4?t=1762007639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Parkour Movement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It changes completely how you play.